  "body": "Welcome to 13 Andrew Jack Road—a light-filled, low-maintenance home offering the ideal blend of comfort, space, and coastal convenience in Silverdale.\r\n\r\nDesigned with easy modern living in mind, the open-plan kitchen and dining area flow smoothly out to private outdoor spaces—perfect for weekend BBQs, entertaining family and friends, or simply unwinding after a busy day.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the ladder, looking for a solid family home, or downsizing without compromising on quality, this property ticks all the right boxes.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Bright, open-plan living and dining with seamless indoor-outdoor connection\r\n• Modern kitchen equipped for easy entertaining\r\n• Low-maintenance section so you can spend your weekends relaxing\r\n• Generous bedrooms, high-quality finishes, and great natural sun\r\n• Internal-access garage plus off-street parking\r\n• Superb location—minutes to Millwater, local schools, Silverdale Centre, beaches, and quick motorway access\r\n\r\nQuality homes in this convenient pocket don't stay available long.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with Team Steenberg: Rick Steenberg, Brendan Langdon on 021 046 9382 today to arrange your private viewing, or pop through one of our upcoming open homes!",
